{"message":"Next, please set your network mode preference to allow 4G and 5G networks. On your device, run:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred")

Let me know once that’s completed."}

{"message":"Please disconnect your VPN connection now. On your device, run:

disconnect_vpn()

Let me know when that’s done."}

{"message":"Great—let’s enable your mobile data. Please run:

toggle_data()

Let me know once your data is enabled."}

{"message":"Please turn off Data Saver mode on your device by running:

toggle_data_saver_mode()

Let me know once Data Saver is disabled."}

{"message":"Let’s start by ensuring your messaging app has the right permissions. Please grant the “messaging” app access to storage on your phone. You can do this by invoking:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="storage").

Once you’ve done that, let me know and we’ll move on to the next step."}

{"message":"Great! Now please reseat your SIM card by invoking:

reseat_sim_card()

Once you’ve done that, let me know and we’ll proceed to the next step."}
